            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ma fodi cik kupong’ ungo, ma fodi ceng’ kukadhu calu cung’ ungo, ma fodi ng’ecwiny ma lake tek pa Yehova kuwok ungo i wiwu, ma fodi ceng’ mi ng’ecwiny pa Yehova kuwok ungo i wiwu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wuyeny Yehova, wu ju ma mol ceke mi ng’om, ma wutimo lembapoka pare; wuyeny bedopwe, wuyeny molcwiny: kuno nyo jubipanuwu i ceng’ mi ng’ecwiny pa Yehova.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.2.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
