              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka kumeno calu abedo kwo, Yehova mir udul uwacu, Mungu mir Israel, Andha Moab bibedo calu Sodom, man nyithindho mir Amon calu Gomora, piny mir ayilayila, man longro mi kadu, man uvuru ma nja: dong’ dhanu para ma bidong’ gibidwokogi ni amaci, man dong’ thek para bicamu pacu i wigi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gibibedo ku maeni ni kuhaya migi, kum gicayu man giyungri gigi kum dhanu pa Yehova mir udul, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova bibedo ni ng’oyondiri igi; kum ebimogo mungu ceke m’i ng’om; man dhanu birwo ire, ku ba dhanu ku ba dhanu ng’atuman i kakare, cil dhu wath ceke mi thek.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.2.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
