              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man udul lim bivuto i dierene, yedi ceke mi thek: alungu ku ceu gibigonjo i wie; dwandgi biwer i wang’ot; uvuru bibedo nuti dhugola: kum eyabu tic mi musonge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maeni adhura mi mutoro ma paru lembe moko ngo, m’uwacu i adundene kumae, Anuti, man ng’atu moko mange mbe an a kenda: aka thwo dwok ma judwoke ko ni uvuru mire ma, kabedo mi yedi ma givuto i ie! ku ba dhanu ceke m’ukadhu kud i vute biewie, man ebiyengo cinge.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.2.15"
            ]
          }
        }
